			<Comment Bounds="305 255 225 28" Id="63" xmlns="http://www.ni.com/MocCommon">
				<p.Text>"Set the tab page for this execution to\nbe the Execution page."</p.Text>
			</Comment>
			<Comment Bounds="140 70 390 82" Id="64" xmlns="http://www.ni.com/MocCommon">
				<p.Text>"The Application Manager generates the StartExecution event when\nan execution starts. The user interface can then update its\ncontrols appropriately.\n\nNote: This VI is marked to be reentrant since it is an ActiveX\nevent callback VI."</p.Text>
			</Comment>
